Structure of decimal.

2
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:20,370
We learn together about decimal structure.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,680
Each decimal number has 2 parts.

4
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:38,200
Whole part and decimal part.

5
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:45,930
they are separated by comma.

6
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:53,620
Digits on left of comma belong to whole part,

7
00:00:53,620 --> 00:01:02,860
digits on right of comma belong to decimal part.

8
